    "description": "<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-csuQGl ckeXDr\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-csuQGl ckeXDr\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-csuQGl ckeXDr\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-csuQGl ckeXDr\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-csuQGl ckeXDr\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-csuQGl ckeXDr\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-csuQGl ckeXDr\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-csuQGl ckeXDr\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 ehClyn sc-caSCKo lfLVbb\">\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Milky Cake has been with us since 2021 and has become one of our bestsellers. Originally developed with Cata Export and Diego Samuel Bermudez at Finca El Paraíso in Colombia, it’s an advanced anaerobic washed Castillo with a profile that’s hard to mistake for anything else. Vanilla cake, pistachio, cardamom and honey, with a creamy sweetness that works as filter, espresso or with milk.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 cLlFgz\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 NlqKE sc-hzDkRC cWvuCl\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 cLlFgz\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 NlqKE sc-cMljjf kQRqJb\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 cLlFgz\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 NlqKE sc-cMljjf kQRqJb\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 cLlFgz\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 NlqKE sc-cMljjf kQRqJb\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 cLlFgz\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 NlqKE sc-cMljjf kQRqJb\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 cLlFgz\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 NlqKE sc-cMljjf kQRqJb\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 cLlFgz\">\n<div class=\"StyledBox-sc-13pk1d4-0 N